<newsitem itemid="425009" id="root" date="1997-03-06" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Ladbroke profits rise in year.</title>
<headline>Ladbroke profits rise in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.44		  vs up 34 pct</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.8		    vs 3.6</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 6.2		    vs 6.0</p>
<p> Pretax preexcept	 163.0		  vs 121.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   3.82 bln	     vs 3.85 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 155 and 165 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Ladbroke Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
